{"4131810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Feed the Circuit", "steam_appid": 4131810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the Circuit, is an high stakes action game starring our main character mpZETA. And this creation has many tricks up its sleeve!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Melee Combat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/6ed827d5999201322691aa4480c20f1e.poster.avif?t=1778700220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/6ed827d5999201322691aa4480c20f1e.webm?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/6ed827d5999201322691aa4480c20f1e.mp4?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dash action can be performed, which will propel you towards the cursor. This action can be used both as a melee attack and as a way to traverse the circuit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slam action can be performed, which can be used as a melee attack. Upon landing a slam attack, you will bounce back up. This gimmick allowss you to chain slams on a stationary target.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranged Combat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/96512dde1edb3f514c5b7287cdc28936.poster.avif?t=1778700220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/96512dde1edb3f514c5b7287cdc28936.webm?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/96512dde1edb3f514c5b7287cdc28936.mp4?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mpZeta comes equipped with 3 weapons by default, all fit for different scenarios:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Revolver: Fires a single concentrated beam that deals high damage.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shotgun: Fires several smaller beams that deal moderate damage.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Machine gun: Fires several beams with rapid succession, dealing moderate damage.</i></strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/918163d311ea86a9beedc780cb260f48.poster.avif?t=1778700220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/918163d311ea86a9beedc780cb260f48.webm?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/918163d311ea86a9beedc780cb260f48.mp4?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Weapon upgrades:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find and buy more pieces as the game goes on, allowing you to upgrade your weapons. Each piece has a special ability, carrying your selected weapon to the next level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pieces can be bought from the shop, or can be found in different areas of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons come equipped with 3 ports, each port having 3 slots. These ports allow you to have several variations of the selected weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Powerups:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups can be bought from the shop or can be found in different areas of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups split up into 2 categories (Passive and Active).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passive powerups serve as small buffs that remain active at all times once equipped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active powerups are tools that are single-use but powerful. They can be used to save or aid yourself during gameplay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lore &amp; Bonus game modes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game comes with an unique and in-depth story. The players who would like to discover it will be rewarded with interesting bits of lore, and maybe something a little more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus game modes are also present, for players who want to enjoy the games mechanics outside of the main story.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the Circuit, is an high stakes action game starring our main character mpZETA. And this creation has many tricks up its sleeve!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Melee Combat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/6ed827d5999201322691aa4480c20f1e.poster.avif?t=1778700220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/6ed827d5999201322691aa4480c20f1e.webm?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/6ed827d5999201322691aa4480c20f1e.mp4?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dash action can be performed, which will propel you towards the cursor. This action can be used both as a melee attack and as a way to traverse the circuit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slam action can be performed, which can be used as a melee attack. Upon landing a slam attack, you will bounce back up. This gimmick allowss you to chain slams on a stationary target.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranged Combat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/96512dde1edb3f514c5b7287cdc28936.poster.avif?t=1778700220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/96512dde1edb3f514c5b7287cdc28936.webm?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/96512dde1edb3f514c5b7287cdc28936.mp4?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mpZeta comes equipped with 3 weapons by default, all fit for different scenarios:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Revolver: Fires a single concentrated beam that deals high damage.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shotgun: Fires several smaller beams that deal moderate damage.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Machine gun: Fires several beams with rapid succession, dealing moderate damage.</i></strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/918163d311ea86a9beedc780cb260f48.poster.avif?t=1778700220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/918163d311ea86a9beedc780cb260f48.webm?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/extras/918163d311ea86a9beedc780cb260f48.mp4?t=1778700220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Weapon upgrades:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find and buy more pieces as the game goes on, allowing you to upgrade your weapons. Each piece has a special ability, carrying your selected weapon to the next level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pieces can be bought from the shop, or can be found in different areas of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons come equipped with 3 ports, each port having 3 slots. These ports allow you to have several variations of the selected weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Powerups:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups can be bought from the shop or can be found in different areas of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups split up into 2 categories (Passive and Active).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passive powerups serve as small buffs that remain active at all times once equipped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active powerups are tools that are single-use but powerful. They can be used to save or aid yourself during gameplay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lore &amp; Bonus game modes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game comes with an unique and in-depth story. The players who would like to discover it will be rewarded with interesting bits of lore, and maybe something a little more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus game modes are also present, for players who want to enjoy the games mechanics outside of the main story.</p>", "short_description": "Feed the Circuit, is a 2D platformer game that provides high stakes action. Varying missions await you as you progress. Customization is key, a personalized arsenal will allow you to uncover the secrets of the circuit. Can you make it through? Not everything is as it seems down here...", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/e09b3c56fcd0a8094333d78d0bafaac5376b87c0/header.jpg?t=1778700220", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/c2d199011994d7622c6d5dec483b3e2a4eae47e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778700220", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131810/c2d199011994d7622c6d5dec483b3e2a4eae47e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778700220", "website": "https://www.rankestudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBA</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ranke Studios"], "publishers": ["Ranke Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 4275390, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Stea